@startuml Admin_Reviews_Management_SSD

actor "Administrator" as Admin
participant "UI: Reviews Management" as UI
participant "Database" as DB

== View Reviews ==

Admin -> UI: Access reviews management
activate UI

UI -> DB: Fetch all reviews
activate DB
DB --> UI: Return reviews list
deactivate DB

UI -> DB: Fetch all sites (for filtering)
activate DB
DB --> UI: Return sites list
deactivate DB

UI --> Admin: Display reviews table with filters
deactivate UI

== Search and Filter Reviews ==

Admin -> UI: Enter search term or select filters\n(site, sort by rating/date)
activate UI

UI -> UI: Apply filters:\n- Search (user, site, review text)\n- Filter by site\n- Sort (latest/oldest/highest/lowest rating)

UI --> Admin: Display filtered results
deactivate UI

== View Review Details ==

Admin -> UI: Click "View" on review
activate UI

UI --> Admin: Show detail modal\n(user info, site, rating, review text,\nphotos, date)

Admin -> UI: Click "Close"

UI --> Admin: Close modal
deactivate UI

== Delete Review ==

Admin -> UI: Click "Delete"
activate UI

UI --> Admin: Show confirmation dialog
Admin -> UI: Confirm delete

UI -> DB: Remove review record
activate DB
DB --> UI: Review deleted
deactivate DB

UI -> DB: Log admin action
activate DB
deactivate DB

UI --> Admin: Show success, refresh list
deactivate UI

@enduml
